# deejay-cog — the names this cog reads. Names only: the values live in
# Doppler (mini-app-polis-ecosystem / dev locally, prd deployed). Run under
# `doppler run -- …`; do not copy this to .env — nothing reads it.
#
# Uncommented names are required in Doppler's dev config, and
# scripts/check_doppler_keys.py checks dev holds every one. Commented names
# are optional: the code has a default, or only one local-only flow needs it.
# Every variable is described in docs/CONFIGURATION.md. In production the
# Lambda gets these from SSM (secrets) and its function environment, both
# declared in mini-app-polis/infra.

# ── API ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Outside production the cog reads the _DEV base URL, with no fallback to
# the production one. Unset, nothing is ingested and run reports are logged
# rather than sent.
KAIANO_API_BASE_URL_DEV=
# This cog's own API key. The API attributes every call to deejay-cog by it.
DEEJAY_COG_API_KEY=

# ── Google ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Service-account JSON for Drive and Sheets, on one line.
GOOGLE_CREDENTIALS_JSON=

# ── Spotify (all three credentials, or Spotify is skipped) ────────────────
SPOTIPY_CLIENT_ID=
SPOTIPY_CLIENT_SECRET=
SPOTIPY_REFRESH_TOKEN=
SPOTIFY_RADIO_PLAYLIST_ID=

# ── Optional ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Environment: unset resolves to local; the Lambda sets production.
# ENVIRONMENT=
# SPOTIPY_REDIRECT_URI=http://127.0.0.1:8888/callback
# SENTRY_DSN=
# LOGGING_LEVEL=INFO
# Folder IDs default to the production folders in config.py.
# CSV_SOURCE_FOLDER_ID=
# DJ_SETS_FOLDER_ID=
# VDJ_HISTORY_FOLDER_ID=
# TIMEZONE=America/Chicago
# Repair pass: days back to check, and repairs per run.
# REPAIR_LOOKBACK_DAYS=183
# REPAIR_MAX_PER_RUN=3

# ── Local-only flows ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# update-dj-set-collection / generate-summaries
# OUTPUT_NAME=DJ Set Collection
# TEMP_TAB_NAME=TempClear
# SUMMARY_TAB_NAME=Summary_Tab
# SUMMARY_FOLDER_NAME=Summary
# DEEJAY_SET_COLLECTION_JSON_PATH=v1/deejay-sets/deejay_set_collection.json
# retag-music (also needs ffmpeg and fpcalc on PATH)
# ACOUSTID_API_KEY=
# RETAG_MIN_CONFIDENCE=0.90
# RETAG_MAX_CANDIDATES=5
# MAX_UPLOADS_PER_RUN=200
# MUSIC_UPLOAD_SOURCE_FOLDER_ID=
# MUSIC_TAGGING_OUTPUT_FOLDER_ID=
